        "section": [
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Severe aortic stenosis, TAVI or surgical valve replacement performed</div>"
            },
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "code": "67781-5",
                  "system": "http://loinc.org",
                  "display": "Summarization of encounter note"
                }
              ]
            },
            "title": "Synthesis"
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you regarding our mutual patient, a 74-year-old male admitted on 20/08/2024 with symptomatic aortic valve stenosis. Echocardiographic assessment confirmed severe aortic stenosis with significantly reduced valve area and elevated mean pressure gradient. Cardiac CT angiography was performed for procedural planning. Following multidisciplinary Heart Team discussion, the patient was deemed suitable for transcatheter aortic valve implantation (TAVI). The procedure was performed successfully on 20/08/2024 via transfemoral access without complications. Post-procedural echocardiography demonstrated excellent prosthetic valve function with no significant paravalvular regurgitation. The patient recovered well and was discharged on 21/08/2024 in stable condition. Please ensure continuation of dual antiplatelet therapy and arrange follow-up echocardiography in three months. Do not hesitate to contact us should any concerns arise.</div>"
            },
            "code": {
